{"id":"471465","name":"丝瓜油条汤","author":"琪_feXjZ8E2","authorId":"10602029","desc":"","cover":"images/471465/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"丝瓜","amount":"1条"},{"name":"油条","amount":"1条"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜末","amount":"少许"},{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"},{"name":"油","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"丝瓜削皮切滚刀块，油条切一段，切点蒜末。","img":"images/471465/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"热锅放油，把蒜末下锅炒香。","img":"images/471465/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"再把丝瓜下锅翻炒一下下。","img":"images/471465/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量的开水，大火煮3分钟。","img":"images/471465/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"再把油条也下锅煮一分钟，调少许盐即可喜欢的放少许鸡粉。","img":"images/471465/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"油条软了就可以盛出了。","img":"images/471465/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"成品。可以品尝咯。","img":"images/471465/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}